un angle\n- Warm "golden hour" lighting characteristic of late afternoon\n- No artificial court lighting active\n- Clear weather with unobstructed natural light\n- Crowd clearly visible without artificial illumination\n\nThis evidence directly supports answer choice C (Dusk) as the time when the game starts.\n\n```json\n{\n    "tool": "FINAL_ANSWER",\n    "frames": [\n        "frames/frame_0024.jpg",\n        "frames/frame_0030.jpg",\n        "frames/frame_0035.jpg",\n        "frames/frame_0039.jpg",\n        "frames/frame_0041.jpg",\n        "frames/frame_0043.jpg",\n        "frames/frame_0058.jpg"\n    ],\n    "answer": "2",\n    "reasoning": "The VLM analysis of the frames where the tennis match begins (0024-0058 seconds) shows long shadows, warm golden-hour lighting, no artificial court lights, and clear visibility of the crowd - all indicating late afternoon/early evening conditions approaching dusk. This matches answer choice C (Dusk).",\n    "answer_criteria": [\n        "Long shadows visible on the court from players and objects, indicating low sun angle characteristic of dusk",\n        "Warm golden-hour lighting tone throughout the frames, consistent with late afternoon/early evening conditions",\n        "No artificial court lighting is active, confirming it\'s not night time",\n        "Clear weather with unobstructed natural light, ruling out \'cloudy so we can\'t tell\' option"\n    ]\n}\n```'}, {'role': 'system', 'content': '📋 CRITIC FEEDBACK (Confidence: 33%)'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': '{\n    "tool": "VLM_QUERY",\n    "frames": ["frames/frame_0019.jpg", "frames/frame_0020.jpg", "frames/frame_0021.jpg", "frames/frame_0022.jpg", "frames/frame_0023.jpg", "frames/frame_0024.jpg", "frames/frame_0025.jpg", "frames/frame_0026.jpg", "frames/frame_0027.jpg", "frames/frame_0028.jpg", "frames/frame_0029.jpg", "frames/frame_0030.jpg", "frames/frame_0031.jpg", "frames/frame_0032.jpg", "frames/frame_0033.jpg", "frames/frame_0034.jpg", "frames/frame_0035.